# Auto deploy (GitHub Pages)

This site deploys from `main` via `.github/workflows/pages.yml` when changes are pushed.

After finishing any code change to the app:

1. Stage only project files (`css/`, `js/`, `index.html`, `.github/`, `.cursor/hooks*`).
2. Commit with a short message describing the fix.
3. Push to `origin/main` so GitHub Pages updates.

Live URL: https://pongvitsam.github.io/DrugInventorySystem/

Bump cache-bust `?v=N` on CSS/JS in `index.html` when static assets change. Tell the user to Ctrl+F5 after deploy.

Do not commit secrets (`.env`, credentials). A Cursor `stop` hook also auto-pushes when the agent finishes.
